  "_agricultural_keywords_comment": "PR D2 — moved from nlp_keywords/is_agricultural.json (which remains as a fallback with a DEPRECATED header). PR-8 bilingual schema. SV-specific cues: cafetalera, ganadera, milpa, potrero, manzanas (Salvadoran traditional area unit). Highest signal: 'finca' alone is very strong. Word boundaries (\\b) on bare single-word patterns are LOAD-BEARING per the 2026-05-24 audit — without them, English 'ranch' substring-matches Spanish 'rancho' (Salvadoran beach-pavilion, NOT a working ranch) and 'finca' substring-matches development names like 'Finca Brava'. Keep the \\b convention when adding patterns.",
